DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmlliiffee reads a PBM image as input, applies the rules of Life to it for
       one generation, and produces a PBM image as output.

       A white pixel in the image is interpreted as  a  live  beastie,  and  a
       black pixel as an empty space.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       There are no command line options defined specifically for ppbbmmlliiffee, but
       it recognizes the options common to all  programs  based  on  libnetpbm
